%% Sprint FX-1 — RF-05 fxResolver cascata estendida (ADR-121 + ADR-061)
%% Nova ordem: users.exchangeRates > system_fx_rates (NOVA) > wallets.exchangeRates > FALLBACK.
%% source: 'user' | 'system' | 'wallets' | 'fallback' | 'mixed'
%% Cache 5min user-level (fxResolver) + 5min system-level (fxRatesPersistence). Convencao QW-1 (ADR-033).

flowchart TD
    Start[Caller chama<br/>fxResolver.resolveExchangeRates userId] --> CacheCheck{Cache user-level<br/>hit? userId in Map<br/>expiresAt > now}

    CacheCheck -->|hit| ReturnCached[Retorna FxRates cacheado<br/>source preservada]
    CacheCheck -->|miss expired| FetchUser[SELECT exchange_rates FROM users<br/>WHERE user_platform_id eq userId]

    FetchUser --> UserHas{users.exchangeRates<br/>tem rates?}

    UserHas -->|sim override| FetchSystem[fxRatesPersistence<br/>getLatestSystemRates]
    UserHas -->|nao default| FetchSystemNoUser[fxRatesPersistence<br/>getLatestSystemRates]

    FetchSystem --> SystemCacheCheck{Cache system-level<br/>5min hit?}
    FetchSystemNoUser --> SystemCacheCheck

    SystemCacheCheck -->|hit| SystemRows[BRL row + EUR row<br/>do cache]
    SystemCacheCheck -->|miss| SystemQuery[SELECT DISTINCT ON currency<br/>currency, rate_per_usd, source, fetched_at<br/>FROM system_fx_rates<br/>ORDER BY currency, date DESC]
    SystemQuery --> SystemRows

    SystemRows --> SystemHas{system_fx_rates<br/>tem BRL EUR?}

    SystemHas -->|sim| FetchWalletsCompat[SELECT exchange_rates FROM wallets<br/>WHERE user_id eq userId AND status active<br/>ORDER BY updated_at DESC]
    SystemHas -->|nao DB vazia primeiro deploy| FetchWalletsCompat

    FetchWalletsCompat --> Merge[Merge logic 4 layers<br/>1 base FALLBACK_FX_RATES<br/>USD 1, BRL 5.0, EUR 0.93<br/>2 wallets.exchangeRates compat<br/>cobre CNY GBP USDT BTC legacy<br/>3 system_fx_rates latest<br/>cobre BRL EUR oficial<br/>4 users.exchangeRates override<br/>precede tudo se existe]

    Merge --> ClassifySource{Origem dominante<br/>para BRL EUR?}

    ClassifySource -->|user override existe e system existe| SourceMixed[source mixed]
    ClassifySource -->|user override existe sem system| SourceUser[source user]
    ClassifySource -->|sem user override system existe| SourceSystem[source system]
    ClassifySource -->|sem user sem system wallets compat| SourceWallets[source wallets]
    ClassifySource -->|nada tudo fallback| SourceFallback[source fallback]

    SourceMixed --> Build[Build FxRates:<br/>rates merged final<br/>source<br/>resolvedAt = new Date]
    SourceUser --> Build
    SourceSystem --> Build
    SourceWallets --> Build
    SourceFallback --> Build

    Build --> CacheStore[cache.set userId<br/>rates expiresAt now plus 5min]
    CacheStore --> ReturnFresh[Retorna FxRates fresh]

    ReturnCached --> Helper[Caller usa helper<br/>convertToUSD amount currency rates<br/>amount dividido por rates currency<br/>QW-1 usd igual native dividido por rate]
    ReturnFresh --> Helper

    Helper --> Result[Valor convertido USD]

    %% Invalidation paths
    InvalidateUser[PUT api user-settings<br/>body.exchangeRates] -.->|invalidateCache userId| CacheCheck
    InvalidateWallet[PUT POST api wallets<br/>body.exchangeRates] -.->|invalidateCache userId| CacheCheck
    InvalidateCron[Cron pos-upsert<br/>refreshFxRates] -.->|invalidateCache global<br/>system e user caches| CacheCheck

    %% Reset to system flow
    ResetBtn[UI Resetar para taxas do sistema<br/>PUT api user-settings exchangeRates] -.->|zera users.exchangeRates<br/>e invalidateCache| FetchUser

    %% userId null edge
    UserNull[userId null<br/>tests anonymous system call] --> ReturnFallbackDirect[Retorna FALLBACK_FX_RATES<br/>USD 1 BRL 5.0 EUR 0.93<br/>source fallback]
    Start --> UserNull

    Note1[Cascata FX-1 4 camadas<br/>1 user override 2 system 3 wallets compat 4 fallback<br/>Currency unknown vai para proxima camada<br/>Convencao QW-1 ADR-033]
    Build -.- Note1

    Note2[FALLBACK_FX_RATES reduzido em FX-1<br/>USD BRL EUR apenas<br/>CNY GBP USDT BTC removidos<br/>Wallets legadas continuam via cascade compat layer 2]
    Merge -.- Note2

    Note3[Cache duplo invalidation<br/>User updates invalidate userId entry<br/>Cron pos-upsert invalidate global<br/>Garantia freshness em 5min pior caso]
    InvalidateCron -.- Note3
